    "body": "https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-filter calls https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#call-a-user-objects-operation which in step 14 (through quite a bit of indirection) ends up running https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#es-unsigned-short  which does https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#abstract-opdef-converttoint which does https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-tonumber at some point which treats null as 0 and undefined as NaN (which then becomes an exception).\r\n\r\nSo I'd say this is defined. I haven't checked if this matches implementations.",
