    "body": "```\r\nconst doc = (new DOMParser()).parseFromString('<html>', 'text/html');\r\ndoc.createTreeWalker(doc, NodeFilter.SHOW_ELEMENT, {\r\n acceptNode: node => node.tagName == \"HTML\" ? 7 : 1\r\n}).nextNode()\r\n==\r\ndoc.createTreeWalker(doc, NodeFilter.SHOW_ELEMENT, {\r\n acceptNode: node => node.tagName == \"HTML\" ? 3 : 1\r\n}).nextNode()\r\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
